- task learning [ 9 , 6 0 , 2 0 , 3 2 ] has been used successfully in applications of natural language processing [ 1 3 , 4 2 ] , speech recognition [ 1 5 ] , computer vision [ 2 2 , 6 1 , 5 2 ] .Especiallyin many computer vision tasks , the effectiveness of multi - task learning has been proved .Fast R - CNN [ 2 2 ] and Faster R - CNN [ 4 0 ] jointly predict the class and the coordinates of objects in an image .Mask R - CNN [ 2 4 ] can efficiently detect objects in an image while simultaneously generating a high - quality segmentation mask for each instance .Large scale variation is one of major factors to influence the performance of many computer vision tasks like face detection , object detection and pose estimation .To address the problem that large strides of deep CNNs make small object detection very difficult , object detector [ 1 0 , 1 4 ] use dilated/atrous convolutions to increase the resolution of the feature map .SDP
